                <div style="width:100%;padding:40px;color:#FFFFFF;">
                    <h5 style="text-align:center;">Resources &amp; Connections</h5>

<div class="btgrid">
	<div class="row row-1">
		<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12">
			<div class="content">
				<p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">
					<img src="https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/b01161b7-c186-44ee-a47b-cc50bb41a927_POH-2.jpeg" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;" class="d-block mx-auto img-fluid rounded">
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12">
			<div class="content">
				<p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">
					Through your involvement with Pathway of Hope, you’ll be introduced to both Salvation Army and other services that are available within your community which offer:
				</p>

				<ul>
					<li>A network of support</li>
					<li>A sense of community</li>
					<li>Holistic programs</li>
					<li>Spiritual guidance</li>
				</ul>

				<p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">
					<strong>Service connector to:</strong>
				</p>

				<ul>
					<li>Job training</li>
					<li>Health services</li>
					<li>Childcare and education</li>
					<li>Housing options</li>
					<li>Legal services</li>
					<li>And much more…</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
